‎## 4. Scoring Protocol
‎
‎**Per ecosystem (e.g., coding assistants, LLM platforms, distribution layers):**
‎
‎- [ ] Score 01-13 for present day
‎- [ ] Provide evidence link for each Confirmed
‎- [ ] Separate: Confirmed Evidence / Interpretation / Hypothesis
‎- [ ] Run Historical Control: 2+ analogies with failure points
‎
‎**Evidence Separation (Per KQ_LOG_2026-08-25 Protocol):**
‎
‎| Layer | Example |
‎| :--- | :--- |
‎| **Confirmed Evidence** | 3 users tested alternative in last 7 days (LOG links) |
‎| **Interpretation** | Diversification starting |
‎| **Hypothesis** | Crossroads stage 05 reached |
‎| **Future Test** | Are they moving work or just experimenting? |
